1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,967
Hilfe, ich bin ein Mensch! Help, I'm a Human! Science is a wrestling match.

2
00:00:07,458 --> 00:00:13,081
Let me tell you about Charles Darwin, Sympathy Instinct: sympathy increased through natural selection.

3
00:00:14,864 --> 00:00:20,755
The Selfish Gene, Ego Boost: survival machines, robot vehicles blindly programmed.

4
00:00:21,998 --> 00:00:27,017
Have you heard of Lynn Margulis, Symbiosis? Not by combat, but by networking.

5
00:00:27,037 --> 00:00:32,077
Survival of the Friendliest, Domestication: enemy turned ally.

6
00:00:32,097 --> 00:00:37,134
Mirror Neurons, Reflection: why I feel what you feel.

7
00:00:37,949 --> 00:00:45,202
Oxytocin, the Cuddle Hormone: increases trust, reduces fear. Warning: aggression against outsiders.

8
00:00:45,222 --> 00:00:50,940
Before we continue, The Vagus Nerve, Calm Down: wandering nerve of compassion.

9
00:00:51,912 --> 00:00:57,094
Pain Center, Social Reject: rejection activates same brain regions as physical pain.

10
00:00:57,855 --> 00:01:02,181
The thing about Thomas Hobbes, Leviathan: life nasty, brutish, and short.

11
00:01:02,799 --> 00:01:07,386
You know Jean-Jacques Rousseau, Natural Goodness: man born free, everywhere in chains.

12
00:01:07,977 --> 00:01:12,421
Rutger Bregman, Humankind: most people, deep down, pretty decent.

13
00:01:12,441 --> 00:01:16,511
Lord of the Flies, Fiction Trap: real kids on islands cooperated.

14
00:01:16,988 --> 00:01:21,051
Michael Tomasello, Pointing: we cooperate to survive; shared intentionality.

15
00:01:21,550 --> 00:01:24,710
The Stag Hunt, Joint Effort: if I chase rabbit, we both lose.

16
00:01:25,489 --> 00:01:30,121
Meanwhile elsewhere, The Free Rider, Exploit: steal benefit. Reason we invented punishment.

17
00:01:30,617 --> 00:01:35,097
The Commons, Elinor Ostrom: what we share grows, unless we believe tragedy myth.

18
00:01:35,649 --> 00:01:39,177
Frans de Waal, Reconciliation: empathy biological, not choice.

19
00:01:39,197 --> 00:01:42,939
The Psychopath, CEO Status: they know lyrics but not music.

20
00:01:42,959 --> 00:01:47,397
Emotional Contagion, Vibe Check: we catch feelings faster than viruses.

21
00:01:48,012 --> 00:01:55,020
Veneer Theory, Cynicism: myth that civilization is thin layer over beast. Blödsinn!

22
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:59,959
Homo Economicus, Rational Fool: rational utility maximizer who doesn't exist.

23
00:01:59,979 --> 00:02:04,171
The Filter Bubble, Echo Chamber: we only see what algorithm wants us to see.

24
00:02:04,191 --> 00:02:08,937
Nobody warned us about Loneliness, Health Hazard: as deadly as 15 cigarettes a day.

25
00:02:09,057 --> 00:02:13,400
Anyway, Digital Distraction, Scroll Doom: we are alone together.

26
00:02:14,311 --> 00:02:17,452
You played Intrinsic Motivation, Flow State: doing it because you love it.

27
00:02:17,553 --> 00:02:20,520
Homo Cooperativus, Synergy: designed to work together.

28
00:02:20,540 --> 00:02:24,448
Which brings us to Bullshit Jobs, Resignation: work that serves no purpose.

29
00:02:24,468 --> 00:02:28,249
The Nudge, Choice Arch: small changes in context can change behavior.

30
00:02:28,513 --> 00:02:32,301
Homo Hapticus, Touch: we cannot live without touch; skin is our social organ.

31
00:02:32,728 --> 00:02:36,545
Do you know Resonance, Hartmut Rosa? When world answers us. Not echo, but answer.

32
00:02:36,766 --> 00:02:40,030
Skin Hunger, Desperation: force connection. We wither without contact.

33
00:02:40,254 --> 00:02:42,926
Flow, Immersion: total absorption; ego dissolves.

34
00:02:43,169 --> 00:02:46,675
Not a metaphor: The Killing Inhibition. Missed Shot. We are not natural killers.

35
00:02:47,102 --> 00:02:52,228
Remember The Christmas Truce, Ceasefire: when propaganda failed, they played football. 1914.

36
00:02:52,803 --> 00:02:55,994
Propaganda, Dehumanize: we need to be lied to in order to kill.

37
00:02:56,260 --> 00:03:01,440
This one has a rule: Non-Violent Resistance. Civil Disobedience. Power comes from obedience. Withdraw it.

38
00:03:02,335 --> 00:03:06,374
I used to believe The Alpha Myth, Debunk: real alphas caretakers, not bullies.

39
00:03:06,640 --> 00:03:10,643
Leveling Mechanism, Ridicule: cutting down tall poppy, keeping egos in check.

40
00:03:10,908 --> 00:03:14,227
Corruption of Power, Brain Damage: gain power, lose Empathy.

41
00:03:14,634 --> 00:03:19,971
Everyone agrees: Egalitarianism. Round Table. For 95% of human history, we lived as equals.

42
00:03:20,525 --> 00:03:23,451
The Helper Toddler, Innate Goodness: we help before we can talk.

43
00:03:23,758 --> 00:03:26,980
Alloparenting, It Takes a Village: Mothers and Others; we share burden.

44
00:03:27,227 --> 00:03:31,453
Homo Ludens, Reset: clear Stage, just game. Play is foundation of culture.

45
00:03:31,800 --> 00:03:34,897
Conditioned Self, Schooling: force card to conform. We are molded.

46
00:03:35,491 --> 00:03:41,408
The deck insists on Immanuel Kant, Categorical Imperative: starry sky above me, moral law within me.

47
00:03:41,594 --> 00:03:44,769
Erich Fromm, To Be: To Have or To Be? Question of sanity.

48
00:03:45,237 --> 00:03:48,610
I once met Martin Buber, I and Thou: all real living is meeting.

49
00:03:48,874 --> 00:03:52,270
Hannah Arendt, Action: banality of evil, but also power of beginning.

50
00:03:52,576 --> 00:03:56,386
Protopia, Incremental Gain: not Utopia. Just little bit better than yesterday.

51
00:03:57,662 --> 00:04:01,273
Welcome to Team Human, Find the Others: being human is team sport.

52
00:04:01,438 --> 00:04:05,853
Self-Fulfilling Prophecy, Manifest: if we believe we are selfish, we become selfish.

53
00:04:05,873 --> 00:04:09,635
Hope, the Verb: hope is verb with its sleeves rolled up.

54
00:04:09,655 --> 00:04:13,753
No wait, Blödsinn! Interrupt: when story gets boring or fake, hit reset button.

55
00:04:13,773 --> 00:04:18,065
You with the card in your hand, Kayfabizarro, the Work: it's fake, but emotion is real.

56
00:04:18,372 --> 00:04:22,806
Did you ever try The Scissors, Cut? Physically cut card in half, destroyed forever.

57
00:04:22,826 --> 00:04:25,545
The Glue Stick, Mashup: make connections where there are none.

58
00:04:25,576 --> 00:04:38,667
Stay Fluffy!
